[{"answer":"So you were both given your project assignments for your senior thesis today, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and we already have to submit our topics next week!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/2.mp3"},{"answer":"But how could they give us a grade this soon?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/3.mp3"},{"answer":"No, next week's due date will not be counted towards your final grade.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/4.mp3"},{"answer":"The teachers are just going to read your topic and give you feedback.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So first we should come up with our topics, and then what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, once you know what you want to study,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/8.mp3"},{"answer":"you need to think about how you'll study it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/9.mp3"},{"answer":"You need to decide on your research methods.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/10.mp3"},{"answer":"The methods will be the main part of your paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/11.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the results section?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I can give you feedback on that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but you will be the one carrying out an experiment","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and thus will have to produce the results on your own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/15.mp3"},{"answer":"What I would like to do today is practice writing research papers before you even begin your report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll give you samples of old data from past experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And you can practice writing results and drawing conclusions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that would be really helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, it sounds like a lot of extra work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/20.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm sure it would make our actual project easier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/21.mp3"},{"answer":"You're exactly right!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/22.mp3"},{"answer":"So let's get started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/23.mp3"},{"answer":"First, let's try this simple experiment on fruit flies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Read the information, and then take 25 minutes to summarise a results and conclusion section.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/25.mp3"},{"answer":"That's really important - pay attention to the time limit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/26.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, does it still have to be 6,000 words?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/27.mp3"},{"answer":"No, don't worry about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/28.mp3"},{"answer":"What if we get off topic?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't worry too much -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/30.mp3"},{"answer":"you will have so much information to write about","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/31.mp3"},{"answer":"that it should be easy to stay on topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/32.mp3"},{"answer":"But what about other sources?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Well for this assignment, you can use the one from your textbook.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/34.mp3"},{"answer":"In your actual paper, you should find old experiments that support your topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So do we need to find different types of sources?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/36.mp3"},{"answer":"For instance, should I be conducting lots of interviews to use in my paper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/37.mp3"},{"answer":"No, there's no need to conduct lots of interviews or anything like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/38.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I'm ready to get started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm still a little confused though, on how we should format our paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry about it for now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but on your final paper, make sure to pay attention to the format.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/42.mp3"},{"answer":"It should follow the guidelines exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh man, I'm starting to understand why they give us all semester to do this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Are there any other small details like that that we should know about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Not a whole lot,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/46.mp3"},{"answer":"make sure you provide two copies - one for your teacher of course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but one for yourself as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, you know the due date, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, it's April the 11th, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/50.mp3"},{"answer":"What? No!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/51.mp3"},{"answer":"It's May 11th. Right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/53.mp3"},{"answer":"The due date is May 11.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Write it down!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh wow. Yeah, I need to note it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, I'm having trouble finding information on my topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/57.mp3"},{"answer":"What if I can't find enough good sources?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It's alright to change your topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Just make sure to do it before the beginning of April.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, I'm definitely going to change it then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Just make sure to write a note to your teacher letting him or her know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. So getting back to writing this sample paper, where do we start?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Should I just explain the experiment and what happened?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you need to start with your hypothesis -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/66.mp3"},{"answer":"what you think will happen -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and then describe your procedure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you can write up the results and your conclusions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh boy, I don't know if I can handle any more instructions...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-3-2023-06-21-10-43-44/70.mp3"}]
